  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0f1e077189d7949c6130b20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她得知自己的活跃表现让故乡人们开始\n感到原来那并非“另一个世界”。\n还得知了……只望着前方奔跑的快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "409996127d6e8e52cc9d9c4649193fa93261b37cc56fa69f56e2f87079c3e0a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bafa4dbf0133123b62da5341",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论日本初次胜利或面临两位强者都不要紧，\n只管坚持不断向前迈进。这就是她的强大之处──\n也就是“王牌”的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be565f7e0b4f82c57604673df77d62f8c5f2468a4466bcba53458f1b2956f14c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ada7590207fecb23285725",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是获胜就能达成日本选手初次称霸“日本杯”。\n对手们皆为强敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42f1dfd215a13b26e7b0e9d78fe7ba56694ce623784b59a1d4ee9442d98f80c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acdda6bcdb7bbeddd78476ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过葛城王牌仍坚持前进。\n背负着支持，只管笔直地……朝向比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "688069f9470ccc4370ec84d11dc746205079d7bbd9c88719b4847a2d3ce3305f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b569ae12f4237cbd21a3ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本C",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e1f84315d13bd4d7813896c86fba6375f2ea4423c867825e53360377150302",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7984f421ca1818a0adde586",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b7f5c58fb9fcd1204accef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有人对葛城王牌跑长距离感到不安，\n尽管如此，还是能够听见\n期待着“王牌”跑法的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "758216c25774e54782cad3b2a9ddb42d1a85e8f67549bc55aa01d3d8b0795d85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:892440a1c74ce58b8253db83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a792cef98aafa89f781a852",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌带给了所有人勇气。\n但这并非一个人的力量，\n同时也要归功于训练员的支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05354a4e5fe0c2b6ad78ca38a7de0ed6c495766947ab5c6f81853f3d77b70b8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79376c6c1e61398b97e9968d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec69e2eb5d964023f0e6760f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，她的致胜关键──\n她的“王牌”就是训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccae8c01efa96e399f5a7ed111716ac6f5abc3faa3b5bd88313f99c3636284be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbaf442f6a44e692b99aeb83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:265cd32636f95110e5ce0559",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "叛逆者，葛城王牌。\n将在“有马纪念”上展现英姿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac8d6455c7db661ca13dacc5d8eab14e469751408c473228a2b968ff941b3ae6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca047041c796db8ab7d91285",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8fa30220b1857c13ac11733",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌在出道战跑出了好成绩！\n但这不过只是起点，她重振精神\n以赛马娘的“王牌”为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a851208f064c3d2caf9290ac310a5b528c6c39fb26f8845185ad92637e5bd0e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab0bd462ec1c7a12dec858a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员提议参加经典三冠路线。\n只要能称霸这堵高墙，\n一定就能证明没有所谓“另一个世界”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eb7f845d168284f53a4c7d7e2e6b41c9eb9b7cff00b14d64086b9e341f9ebd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f7f022aa97a74bddc47b679",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同期的千明代表也即将迎向出道。\n以她的实力，\n一旦开跑就能远远甩开葛城王牌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c0a1ac6ce04951e65d1821c77b84e0e27030cdd8038aad717d7858171df91f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60ba6ad73088041141ea1b59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表的背影还很遥远。\n葛城王牌坚定地下定决心开始进行武者修行，\n一定要追上对方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f0b8c10209c05baa8d1946443a5f7b7496a881e123bb017f2a2de3c571327bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e615e61aed9125b07596dc4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・各自的起点",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef15fda85b3be8acfbf47a0e23f6d47cb36b37141544c7d84e8a318e010379e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04784cf0ce8c388b95202a49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌在“共同通信杯”\n顺利地跑完全程，但赛场内的关注\n都集中在千明代表身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b85667d2ad0e507d6ed57b325bf0a4cb7c18a30b1019bdc2ca525af8dc3c916d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0caf8a58c2523e2bd054f34e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的跑法确实就像完全不同次元，\n这正是导致自己想超越对方的原因。\n这么思考着的葛城王牌她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b898246d7f5a7e4c1d32567178d655fdda97d8e5645ee148427c0a6dbffed6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4b3cb1a860dc9c8c77bc1d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "向千明代表下了战帖。\n“在经典三冠上，和我用三场比赛决胜负吧”\n此发言转瞬间便传遍了日本。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f833d57684c190d6daa5a44a45606d3f2e06356448b5f719a22a56c98e07f5be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c69b82d4811240b3150fcebf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "世间一面倒地认为千明代表会获得压倒性胜利。\n但葛城王牌的朋友们却不这么想。\n她们希望她作为“王牌”好好努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "453a865f95f4c5f236f7c94d7b0b89530242d3cae7616e2a57c5f8533a3845d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f08fe09fdcfe64424fae82d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "朋友们表示她向强者发起挑战的姿态为自己\n再次点燃奔跑的热情。葛城王牌说要与她们\n“一起战斗”，用力地握紧了拳头！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c3f8bb57c4b3e23e557291e9cb1c2621d053546933415b13e72d2b1be4ea85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e80eed4ac445602db0156471",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "共同通信杯束后・奋战之人",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebbd67873b398b37785a1713e167d9bf10a2152d3c3307c4bc089ac51533135f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2466a2ee456d2c91e9eea7ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌朝着“皋月赏”前进，\n稳健地累积着实力。然而，\n世人的期待集中在千明代表和──",
      "source_fingerprint": "62834e834686f2e97c9546c58b5dde1f2f101846117d1b305f437b78153e885f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdb46e70f775ea3242ea5329",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来自名门的椎名弗雷瑞斯身上。\n丝毫不见人们讨论起葛城王牌的名字，\n不过椎名弗雷瑞斯本人却不同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98b66e655e24723bbe524e025754e995165326e6ac3c81ed26c6d0f131de46d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7b29ea3dfd9dbb8c5b2394a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她关注着葛城王牌的进步。\n除此之外还发出宣言说要\n一口气打倒葛城王牌和千明代表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85789852b1e7eb7f769c790399f89ad843e7c92f0dab93b8fa01cae68cf4225d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104420.json",
      "json_path": [
