    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cef34caed5f6e7ad697117bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌在“皋月赏”中胜利了。\n但她却没办法坦率地感到开心。\n因为这场比赛几乎逼近她的极限。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da9361f8b610cee319fc93a6d516eefc0abaa46846c52a5318fdf5d53dcbfe00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
