    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d6e41a4e44b14821fe2d6b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相较之下，败北的千明代表\n则是愉快地说着\n她非常期待“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cafa2104904bd30873a2e984446f29c49c7e8dceabfe0859501c8b40f607df6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
