      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是训练员相信着她。\n她都已经变得这么强了，所以会赢的。\n所以在“日本德比”也要拿下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b692c7baa92261047c0f70a35cf1b8de160e260ab43f0329f10a917b1e0d7dda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
