      "uid": "zhcn:c6dbedff7ae95ba7ab27aa14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表称霸了“日本德比”。\n葛城王牌虽已使尽全力，\n但凭现在的实力还是追不上对方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcffad2030a817d8b75f16929de528655bac69f7e956f1435601bb7cb95095cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
