    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf6ebcc4dedaa33cbfe68188",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管如此，训练员和朋友对她的信任\n依旧坚定不移。葛城王牌为了回应期待，\n坚定地宣告下次一定会赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "298a5df5fdf3918b85cd3407c11cf5479220cb6d407d304522fb55cd4c3af792",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
